WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:04.013
Here's how to read the plan, using Monday's real ES plan.

00:04.013 --> 00:07.631
ES on the 15 minute chart, Friday and Sunday night.

00:07.631 --> 00:10.227
Start with the bias. Monday's is bullish.

00:10.227 --> 00:13.309
Bullish doesn't mean chase. Let price come to you.

00:13.309 --> 00:15.136
Next, what it takes to go long.

00:15.136 --> 00:18.959
Price flushes below Long 1, then reclaims it and holds.

00:18.959 --> 00:22.691
That's the failed breakdown. Buy the reclaim, not the flush.

00:22.691 --> 00:26.159
Long 1 is 7,826.75.

00:26.159 --> 00:34.496
